{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"29774af9e37e3076","name":"card_unit_57th_rifles","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/BloodIron/units/card_unit_57th_rifles","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"57th RIFLES","text":"When you deploy or add a T-34 tank, it fights a random enemy unit.","flavorText":"The 57th Motor Rifle Brigade was part of the 16th Guards Tank Division during WWII. The division was an elite armored unit of the Red Army,  notorious for its role in some of the most critical battles on the Eastern Front. It was originally formed as the 16th Tank Corps, but was promoted to Guards status in 1943 for its bravery and effectiveness in combat, particularly in the Battle of Stalingrad, where it played a significant role in surrounding and defeating the German forces. The division continued to prove itself valuable in following operations, including the Battle of Kursk in 1943, where it contributed to the Soviet victory in the largest tank battles in history. Later, the 16th Guards Tank Division participated in major Soviet offensives, such as Operation Bagration in 1944, helping push German forces back through Belarus and eventually to Eastern Europe. By the end of the war, the division had advanced into Germany where it participated in the Battle of Berlin, which led to the final defeat of Nazi Germany. After the war the division was stationed in Eastern Germany until 1991 when the Soviet Union was dissolved, resulting in the withdrawal of remaining units from Germany.","faction":"Soviet","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":3,"defense":5},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_57th_rifles","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_57th_rifles_title","SourceString":"57th RIFLES","LocalizedString":"57th RIFLES"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":3,"defense":5,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_57th_rifl